      "text": "By virtue of and pursuant to the authority vested in me by the act of June 25,\n1910 (ch. 421, 36 Stat. 847), as amended by the act of August: 24, 1912 (ch. 369,\n37 Stat. 497), and subject to the conditions therein expressed and to all valid existing\nrights, it is ordered that the following-described public lands in the States of Loui-\nsiana and Mississippi be, and they are hereby, temporarily withdrawn from settle-\nment, location, sale, or entry, for classification and pending determination as to the\nadvisability of including such lands in national forests:\n\nLouisiana MERIDIAN\n\nT.15S., R. 7 W., sec. 32, SEXNEX.\nT.15S., R. 8 W., sec. 35, SEXYSW.\n\nSt. SterHens MERIDIAN\n\nR. 9 W., sec. 33, SWYSEX.\nR. 9 W., sec. 1, SWKNWX.\nR. 10 W., sec. 33, SWYSEX.\n25S., R. 10 W., sec. 13, NEXYSWX.\nR. 10 W., sec. 7, WKSW.\nR. 11 W., sec. 6, SEXSEX;\nsec. 11, NEYSW%,.\nR. 11 W., sec. 1, NEXNW*%.\n5N.,R. 6 W., sec. 6, SEXSEX.\n6N.,R. 7 W., sec. 8, NWYNWK;\nsec. 12, SWY%NW4,.\n.2N.,R. 9 W., sec. 38, NWYNWK, EXSWX;\nsec. 34, NEYSWk;\nsec. 35, SWYSWX.\n. 9 W., sec. 32, NEXNWX.\n, R. 10 W., sec. 32, NEXNEX;\nsec. 33, NW¥NWi;\nsec. 36, S¥ of lot 7.\nT.2N., R. 10 W., sec. 9, NEYSWX.\nT.1N., R.11 W., sec. 7, SWYNEX.\nT.3N., R. 12 W., sec. 36, NEXNEX.\n\nThis order shall continue in full force and effect unless and until revoked by the\nPresident or by act of Congress.\n\nB 38H A8HaH8aH\n—\nTM\n\nHH\nfos)\n4 f\nrs\n\nFRANKLIN D. ROOSEVELT.\nTas Waite Hovsz,\n\nMarch 6, 1984.\n[No. 6629]"
    }
  ],
